<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24678" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδάκνω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δήξομαι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bite hard,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				6.2
			</span></i>: metaph. of calumny, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.87.5
				</span></i>
			; of sarcasm, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				21
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λά</span>:—
				Med.
			, <i>have a biting-match with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ Κερβέρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.1105a
				</span></i>
			; <i>bite each other,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνίδια διαδακνόμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					M.Ant.
					5.33
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
